  "description": "A skillful secretary by day and choosy cruiser by night, Su-Ha is a young professional who’s in search of some no-strings-attached action. He hasn’t had much luck lately, though, since a handsome face doesn’t always match what’s in a guy’s pants. This might be why he finds himself wondering about his dreamboat boss, Director Park Ji-Woon. But there’s no way he can mix business with pleasure… That is, until Ji-Woon and Su-Ha run into each other in the gay bar bathroom. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Contains 54 side story chapters.*",
